  "solution": "Logic followed here is:\n\nLogic:** (First number × 3 + Second number) + 1 = Third number.**\n\nGiven:\n\n(4, 10, 23)\n\n⇒ (4 × 3 +10) + 1 = 23\n\n⇒ (12 + 10) + 1 = 23\n\n⇒ 23 = 23\n\n(8, 22, 47)\n\n⇒ (8 × 3 +22) + 1 = 47\n\n⇒ (24 + 22) + 1 = 47\n\n⇒ 47 = 47\n\nNow, checking the options:\n\nOption 1) (6, 16, 29)\n\n⇒ (6× 3 + 16) + 1 = 29\n\n⇒ (18 + 16) + 1 = 29\n\n⇒ 35 ≠ 29.\n\nOption 2) (5, 13, 23) \n\n⇒ (5 × 3 + 13) + 1 = 23\n\n⇒ (15 + 13) + 1 = 23 \n\n⇒ 28 ≠ 23 \n\noption 3) (10, 28, 53)\n\n⇒ (10 × 3 + 28) + 1= 53\n\n⇒ (30 + 28) + 1 = 53\n\n⇒59 ≠ 53\n\noption 4) (7, 19, 41) \n\n**⇒ (7 × 3 + 19) + 1 = 41**\n\n**⇒ (21 +19) + 1 = 41**\n\n**⇒ 41 = 41.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \" Option 4\".**",
